{
    "word": "eagerness",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c749c460-87a8-3acb-b319-2469dbdaf344",
                "word": "eagerness",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "63cd6e6f-46f9-4ae5-860e-53946ef95cfc",
                        "entry_id": "c749c460-87a8-3acb-b319-2469dbdaf344",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "eagernesses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "65d036ee-124b-3f8c-b46d-a8c89e4d7640",
                        "entry_id": "c749c460-87a8-3acb-b319-2469dbdaf344",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state or quality of being eager; ardent desire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bc9350b-2d25-48f0-a508-71afffba8f03",
                                "sense_id": "65d036ee-124b-3f8c-b46d-a8c89e4d7640",
                                "text": "The things he had to tell about...were enough to make you almost tremble with excitement, when you heard all the intimate details from an animal charmer and realized with what thrilling eagerness and anxiety the whole busy underworld was working."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f0137bf-0243-47cd-ad53-e92ecc29bf5e",
                                "sense_id": "65d036ee-124b-3f8c-b46d-a8c89e4d7640",
                                "text": "Meanwhile the larger company was showing no great eagerness to yield to the pressure of South Wales interests to convert its gauge, and with a view to forcing the pace, the Llynvi & Ogmore in 1871 promoted a remarkable railway from an extension of its system already authorised near Blackmill, eastward across country to join the Rhymney Railway at Nantgarw, in the Vale of Taff, above Cardiff."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "432658ed-9192-3e14-8f3b-7b855cbc3663",
                        "entry_id": "c749c460-87a8-3acb-b319-2469dbdaf344",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tartness, sourness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8eb665a3-d5b8-4f30-834a-8c2833c2209c",
                                "sense_id": "432658ed-9192-3e14-8f3b-7b855cbc3663",
                                "text": "Senvie, which is of a most biting and stinging tast, of a fierie effect,[…]serveth also to make a pretie dish of meat to be eaten, being boiled or stewed between too^([sic – meaning two]) little dishes in some convenient liquor, in such sort, as a man shall not feele it to bite at the tongues end, nor complaine of any eagernesse that it hath."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fc85f11-962b-4b6d-8ae1-c1bf432d2884",
                                "sense_id": "432658ed-9192-3e14-8f3b-7b855cbc3663",
                                "text": "Presently the balsamick body is wounded, and turns sour sooner or later according to the degree of the motion; for this fierce motion or working wastes the pure spirituous Balsam, and awakens the original Qualities of Saturn and Mars, viz. an astringent Eagerness, or sour hard Quality, that would not have been manifested, if this irregular Motion had not excited it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e86700af-99c4-430e-98a1-d0c7af4b1133",
                                "sense_id": "432658ed-9192-3e14-8f3b-7b855cbc3663",
                                "text": "To this I answer that Beer nor Ale can be drawed off so fine from the Mash-Tun or Cooler, as to want a sufficient Sediment to feed it, as may be easily proved by an Observation when the Drink is drawn off, that never yet appeared to me without rather too much of this filthy Compound, which by its earthy and saline Parts naturally induces Hardness and Eagerness in the Liquor."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ffe30d9-da82-492f-9ab2-985405cb2653",
                        "source_entry_id": "c749c460-87a8-3acb-b319-2469dbdaf344",
                        "source_sense_description": "The state or quality of being eager",
                        "target_lang_word": "Eifer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Eifer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7be879a4-fcd3-3f7d-a721-c535c5995449",
                                        "entry_id": "dba4c613-df3f-354b-959d-b6baeb055a41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ernsthaftes Bemühen, Verfolgen eines Ziels"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1742ae55-bf59-4148-b35b-6a12eb3f5197",
                                                "sense_id": "7be879a4-fcd3-3f7d-a721-c535c5995449",
                                                "text": "Er zeigte deutlichen Eifer, als er seine Hausaufgaben erledigte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "584e5cbe-7f11-4062-83ce-fae516f3f415",
                                                "sense_id": "7be879a4-fcd3-3f7d-a721-c535c5995449",
                                                "text": "Die Grundlage der nächsten Budgetsanierung wird gerade mit großem Eifer geschaffen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1378fa8a-3fe3-43e8-9861-f27c7f509edd",
                                                "sense_id": "7be879a4-fcd3-3f7d-a721-c535c5995449",
                                                "text": "Wie eine Schlange glitt er zurück, während der junge Harpunier, der seine erste Reise in dieser Eigenschaft machte, vor Eifer zitternd nach vorn sprang und die schon bereit liegende Lanze aufgriff."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a16301f1-12cc-36a1-988b-a3a07426e5ba",
                                        "entry_id": "dba4c613-df3f-354b-959d-b6baeb055a41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Begeisterung für eine Sache"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddf590e9-3a04-4e9a-a6a1-494e6b470afc",
                                                "sense_id": "a16301f1-12cc-36a1-988b-a3a07426e5ba",
                                                "text": "Sie wurde von dem Junker Henning geleitet, sein Landsmann, der Ritter Apitz von Rochow, führte die Ursula und umwarb sie wiederum mit feurigem Eifer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f81b827a-3041-4548-baf2-08af3aceedd6",
                                                "sense_id": "a16301f1-12cc-36a1-988b-a3a07426e5ba",
                                                "text": "Diese folgten seinem lauten, deutlichen Gebell, dessen Eifer ihnen verrieth, daß das treue Thier endlich das Ziel ihrer Begierde aufgefunden hatte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f57fa69-8d81-445e-8652-0519f135cb0b",
                                                "sense_id": "a16301f1-12cc-36a1-988b-a3a07426e5ba",
                                                "text": "„Amalie freute sich über den Eifer und die Sorgsamkeit ihres Bruders.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6c1baea-fa3c-3bad-997a-d1b8c422aa34",
                                        "entry_id": "dba4c613-df3f-354b-959d-b6baeb055a41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "aufgeregte Eile"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc0d827c-af71-41db-a232-d633fbbe9975",
                                                "sense_id": "a6c1baea-fa3c-3bad-997a-d1b8c422aa34",
                                                "text": "Mit Eifer und Gewalt faßt sie die Hände beider Ehegatten, drückt sie zusammen und eilt auf ihr Zimmer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "228f2e7c-4eb9-4a82-8003-cb12d0d50f47",
                                                "sense_id": "a6c1baea-fa3c-3bad-997a-d1b8c422aa34",
                                                "text": "Das Kuratorium rät zu einer defensiven Fahrweise. Auch wenn einen nach einem langen Sommer der Eifer packt, sollten regelmäßig Pausen eingelegt werden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd4b023c-6ffd-41bd-b653-9d031775d97e",
                                                "sense_id": "a6c1baea-fa3c-3bad-997a-d1b8c422aa34",
                                                "text": "Dazu gehört Stanley Milgrams Gehorsamsexperiment, in dem er zeigte, wie Menschen in ihrem Eifer, Befehle auszuführen, ihren Mitmenschen tödliche Stromstöße verabfolgten."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
